  "invariants": [
    "All backend routes are mounted on api_router with /api prefix in backend/server.py.",
    "Provider order in frontend/app/_layout.tsx is Network -> Language -> Currency -> Auth -> Subscription.",
    "transactions use is_deleted + updated_at soft-delete; mirror any new field in frontend/services/localDb.ts and addPendingTransaction.",
    "SUBSCRIPTION_TIERS and PRODUCT_TIER_MAP in backend/server.py must be updated together.",
    "Client transaction CRUD goes through addPendingTransaction (local-first), not apiClient directly.",
    "AI keys (EMERGENT_LLM_KEY, OPENAI_API_KEY) are server-only.",
    "frontend/constants/Config.ts is the single source of truth for BACKEND_URL until env-var rollout.",
    "Root-level *_test.py files are integration scripts; pytest unit suites live under backend/ only."
  ],
